keywords:
  - Kwant
  - quantum transport
  - tight-binding
  - topological insulators
  - Majorana
  - Jupyter
abstract: >-
  A self-contained, fully executed Jupyter course on quantum transport with
  Kwant 1.5: theory next to runnable code for the core API, ten topological
  models (SSH, Kitaev, Majorana nanowire, Thouless pump, Haldane, Kane-Mele,
  p+ip, BBH, Weyl, 3D TI), with a solutions notebook for its 25 exercises, a Windows
  installer and installation-verification scripts.
